    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"A USGS map has been compiled that shows the thickness and character of Quaternary sediments in the glaciated United States east of the Rocky Mountains (Soller, in press a,b,c,d).  The map was compiled at 1:1,000,000 scale from about 850 sources of information.  A discussion of the map's scope and format is given in Soller (1992).\"",
